        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Adventist World, Girls' Life\n- People: Ángel Manuel Rodríguez, Carol Weston\n- Places: Silver Spring, Maryland; Seoul, Korea; Baltimore, Maryland\n- Roles: editors, advice columnist, monthly columnist, author\n\nFacts:\n- Since 1994, Carol Weston has been the “Dear Carol” advice columnist at Girls' Life.\n- Adventist World has editors based in Silver Spring, Maryland, and Seoul, Korea.\n- Girls' Life is headquartered in Baltimore, Maryland.\n- Ángel Manuel Rodríguez writes a monthly column in Adventist World.\n- Ángel Manuel Rodríguez has written several books.\n- Carol Weston is the author of sixteen fiction and non-fiction books.",
